<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0407_R47_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Well, wassup!\rThey say past this hole used to be\na huge tower reachin’ into the sky.\rThey say it was a real weird\ntower with half of it stuck\fin the cliff.\rIt wasn’t just a tall tower reachin’\nup to the sky, but reachin’ deep\fdown underground too!\rRumor is it even reached the\nbottom of the ocean!\rBasically, the ruins used to connect\nthe sky, the land, and the\fsea to each other...\rMost of the tower crumbled now,\nand all that’s left is\fthe entrance and the inside, where\fyou see weird patterns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0407_R47_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I think this buildin’ was built for\nhomies with a strong connection to the\fsea,\fland, and sky.\fAnd a terrible architect.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0407_R47_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A MASKED MAN lookin’ GREAT in front of a\nCRASHIN’ waterfall...\fThat’s ME, CRASHER WAKE!\rWho DARE talk to me so casual?\rOh! You that mask-crazy Hustler I saw\nat the Celadon Dept. Store! My mask\fbuddy!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0407_R47_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wake: I heard about the big waterfall\nnear Cianwood and came to SEE it!\rThis waterfall is AWESOME! I’m takin’\nselfies! In my mask!\rNo person or homie can survive without\nwater, but water can WRECK you too.\fI learned that slippin’ on these rocks.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0407_R47_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wake: You must be a Hustler from\naround here, right?\rI hope you become a Hustler\nlike water--\fstrong, hard to beat, but\frefreshin’.\rGood luck, mask-crazy {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0407_R47_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Chuck: OOOMPH!\nYou came ALL this way just to see ME?\rThen take a pic with me too!\nFlex with me! Yes? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0407_R47_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Chuck: Say CHEESE!\nDon’t close your eyes! FLEX!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0407_R47_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Chuck: GREAT pic!\nI look HUGE. Don’t show my wife.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0407_R47_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Chuck: NO? You came all the way out\nhere to say NO?! That’s cold!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0407_R47_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your Photo Album full.\rGo on your PC and delete\nsome pics.</language>
	</row>
</body>
